        "description": "Find, aim, shoot - be a hunter, join hunting clash!\n\nEnjoy the hunting game with open world. Hunting Simulator Game isn’t just deer hunting classic or any other wild hunt. This game is made by the real hunter, who is a fan of the sniper shooting. \n\nHear the call of the wild and feel like a hunting sniper.\nDeer/buck, elk/moose, bear and wild boar, wolf, fox and hare are all represented here. Try to find all of them. Be persistent and patient because it could be difficult sometimes to find some of them in the grass and thickets. You may not meet them all on your first hunt. But rest assured, they are here and just hiding.\nUse different hunting rifles and shotguns to get your trophies. \nBe careful cause the animals are dangerous and some of them can attack you! But if they don't attack, consider yourself lucky this time. In any case, you can try your luck with a knife in your hands.\n\nPlease, keep in mind that we continue developing and plan to improve the hunting world of the game.\n\nUpdate is coming! Get ready to compete.\n\n",
